Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 17:17:21 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] test(v2): regenerate chain fixtures for the legacy-coinbase
 regtest chain

The framework's regtest chain now has legacy coinbases and the T1 genesis,
so the deterministic tip hashes and UTXO set hashes move:
- feature_deterministic_chain_setup: the tips at heights 100 and 110 and
  the UTXO set hash at 110;
- feature_utxo_set_hash: hash_serialized of the cached chain (MuHash is
  unchanged);
- rpc_dumptxoutset: the base hash, file digest and txoutset hash.

The regtest m_assumeutxo_data in chainparams is not regenerated here.

Rebase onto coordinator 276 (81e8ef1774): the rpc_dumptxoutset values were
already regenerated by the coordinator for its own chain and are kept; this
commit's values for them were computed on another base and are dropped.
All three fixtures' values are unverified on this stack (no runtime suites
run) and need regeneration in the final runtime phase.

Tier: V2

